<?xml version='1.0' standalone='yes'?>
<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN>



<PLUGIN
  name="docktail-preview"
  author="vcolombo"
  version="2026.09.03.3"
  launch="Settings/DockTail"
  pluginURL="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vcolombo/docktail-unraid/main/plugin/docktail-preview.plg"
  support="https://github.com/vcolombo/docktail-unraid/issues"
  min="7.0.0"
>

<CHANGES>
<![CDATA[

### 2026.09.03.3

Fixes clickable help not working: no label showed the help cursor.

The feature relied on Unraid's page-load help wiring, which refuses to pin a table row lacking a <td> (so the Containers block got no pin) and only ever sees markup present at load. The plugin now wires its own help on every tab, deferring so it never double-binds on top of Unraid's wiring, and the Status tab rebinds after its AJAX refresh.

### 2026.09.03.2

Adds clickable per-field help across all four tabs, matching the native Unraid pattern: click any field name to toggle its explanation, or use the Help button in the header to toggle all of them.

- 47 help blocks covering every setting, preflight check, container column and version field.
- OAuth client ID and secret now have separate help; the Funnel fields, service protocol and generated-output box gained help they were missing.
- The Status tab re-wires help after its AJAX refresh and honours an already-active Help toggle.
- Remedies for failing checks remain visible without clicking.

### 2026.09.03.1

Fixes two Status tab rendering bugs:

- Check remedies were invisible (Unraid hides inline_help until Help is toggled), so a failing check rendered an empty row. Remedies are now always visible.
- Start/Stop/Restart/Refresh rendered stacked full-width above the page; they now sit directly under the service state.


For older releases, see https://github.com/vcolombo/docktail-unraid/releases
]]>
</CHANGES>

<FILE Name="/boot/config/plugins/docktail/docktail-unraid-2026.09.03.3-noarch-1.txz">
<URL>https://github.com/vcolombo/docktail-unraid/releases/download/2026.09.03.3/docktail-unraid-2026.09.03.3-noarch-1.txz</URL>
<SHA256>ba93e18cc5578b320c208708ecd990a16e5de3083e40f4edfd9d71d339777b27</SHA256>
</FILE>

<!--
The 'install' script. Unraid re-installs every /boot/config/plugins/*.plg on
boot, so this runs at boot too: it must be idempotent and must not fail when
Docker or Tailscale are still down.
-->
<FILE Run="/bin/bash">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
if [ -d "/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/docktail" ]; then
    rm -rf /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/docktail
fi

upgradepkg --install-new /boot/config/plugins/docktail/docktail-unraid-2026.09.03.3-noarch-1.txz

mkdir -p /boot/config/plugins/docktail

# Keep tailnet credentials out of Unraid Connect's flash backup, which is a git
# repo at /boot/.git.
echo "credentials.cfg" > /boot/config/plugins/docktail/.gitignore

if [ ! -f "/boot/config/plugins/docktail/credentials.cfg" ]; then
    install -m 0600 /dev/null /boot/config/plugins/docktail/credentials.cfg
fi
chmod 0600 /boot/config/plugins/docktail/credentials.cfg

# Drop the other release channel so both are never installed at once.
rm -f /boot/config/plugins/docktail.plg
rm -f /var/log/plugins/docktail.plg

# Start (or restart) the daemon. Deferred, so a blocking Unraid event returns
# immediately.
/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/docktail/restart.sh

# Clean up superseded packages.
rm -f $(ls /boot/config/plugins/docktail/docktail-unraid-*.txz 2>/dev/null | grep -v '2026.09.03.3')

echo ""
echo "----------------------------------------------------"
echo " docktail-preview has been installed."
echo " Plugin version:   2026.09.03.3"
echo " DockTail version: 1.7.9"
echo ""
echo " Configure it under Settings -> Network Services ->"
echo " DockTail. DockTail needs the Tailscale plugin and a"
echo " tagged Unraid node; the Status tab checks both."
echo "----------------------------------------------------"
echo ""
]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>

<!--
The 'remove' script. Settings under /boot/config/plugins/docktail are left in place:
Unraid convention is that plugin settings survive removal.
-->
<FILE Run="/bin/bash" Method="remove">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
/usr/local/etc/rc.d/rc.docktail stop 2>/dev/null

removepkg docktail-unraid

rm -rf /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/docktail
rm -f /boot/config/plugins/docktail/*.txz
]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>

</PLUGIN>
